748
01:10:21,208 --> 01:10:22,416
Hai. Aku mau kencing.

749
01:10:23,208 --> 01:10:24,500
Tadi luar biasa!

750
01:10:24,583 --> 01:10:28,041
Terima kasih! Tapi, aku mau kencing.
