939
01:34:43,958 --> 01:34:47,250
Kau lebih sering bilang,
"Diam, Weigel" daripada cinta.

940
01:34:48,416 --> 01:34:51,041
Itu karena "Diam, Weigel"
caraku bilang cinta.

941
01:34:52,250 --> 01:34:53,166
Aku benci kau.

942
01:34:54,375 --> 01:34:56,708
Diam, Weigel.

943
