Jadi, kalian berpacaran.

952
01:36:02,958 --> 01:36:04,375
Sampai akhir hayat, Kawan.

953
01:36:06,416 --> 01:36:10,000
Pria ini sungguh kasmaran.
Kalian berdua. Dasar aneh.

954
01:36:10,916 --> 01:36:12,291
Kami yang terburuk.

955
01:36:12,375 --> 01:36:13,791
Paling terburuk.

956
01:36:17,541 --> 01:36:19,208
Kami akan merindukanmu, Sepupu.

957
01:36:23,500 --> 01:36:24,583
Jaga Hasley.

958
01:36:25,708 --> 01:36:28,625
Kurasa dia tak perlu dijaga.

959
01:36:28,708 --> 01:36:31,125
Tapi, serahkan pada sepupu favoritmu.

960
01:36:37,041 --> 01:36:39,291
-Kemarilah.
-Apa?

961
01:36:40,166 --> 01:36:42,916
-Hei, aku juga mau.
-Kau sangat iri.

962
01:36:43,000 --> 01:36:44,250
Beri aku kasih sayang.

963
